      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "(FT) on play data. (b) Average performances of D-MPC variants on D4RL locomotion tasks. The full D-MPC",
      "bbox": [
        82.62300109863281,
        173.57916259765625,
        528.3179321289062,
        181.4965057373047
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "method is bottom right. MS: multi-step, SS: single step, Diff: diffusion, ART: auto-regressive transformer. Our",
      "bbox": [
        83.70099639892578,
        184.53814697265625,
        528.5531005859375,
        192.4554901123047
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "baseline MBOP uses ensembling and MPPI trajectory optimization with SS MLP dynamics models and SS MLP",
      "bbox": [
